		"name": "NestJS Portfolio API",
		"description": "Production-ready Postman collection for the NestJS Clean Architecture Portfolio API.\n\n### Authentication & Environment\n- Collection includes pre-configured collection variables: `baseUrl`, `accessToken`, `refreshToken`, `adminEmail`, and `adminPassword`.\n- Login, Register, and Refresh endpoints include automated test scripts that capture `accessToken` and `refreshToken` and store them in collection variables.\n- Protected endpoints automatically inherit Bearer Token authorization from the collection.",
